Keep a shared source as an empty list of text.
Place "/*Test program */" into source.
Place "int main()" into source.
Place "{ " into source.
Place "  // variable declaration " into source.
Place "int a, b, c;" into source.
Place "/* This is a test" into source.
Place "   multiline  " into source.
Place "   comment for " into source.
Place "   testing */" into source.
Place "a = b + c;" into source.
Place "}" into source.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared newline as empty text.
Place "\n" into newline.

To flush.
The size is the number of characters in current.
If size is more than 0, Place current into answers.
Set current to empty text.

The joined is join source with newline.
The last is the last position of joined.
The inblock is 0.
The silent is 0.
The spot is 0.
Repeat while spot is at most last.
The symbol is the slice of joined from spot to spot plus 1.
The pair is symbol.
If spot is less than last, set pair to the slice of joined from spot to spot plus 2.
The opening is 0.
The closing is 0.
The notice is 0.
The newlinehere is 0.
If pair matches "/*", set opening to 1.
If pair matches "*/", set closing to 1.
If pair matches "//", set notice to 1.
If symbol matches newline, set newlinehere to 1.
The used is 1.
If inblock is 1 and closing is 1, set inblock to 0, set used to 2.
If inblock is 0 and newlinehere is 1, Flush, set silent to 0.
If inblock is 0 and newlinehere is 0 and silent is 1, set used to 1.
If inblock is 0 and newlinehere is 0 and silent is 0 and opening is 1, set inblock to 1, set used to 2.
If inblock is 0 and newlinehere is 0 and silent is 0 and notice is 1, set silent to 1, set used to 2.
If inblock is 0 and newlinehere is 0 and silent is 0 and opening is 0 and notice is 0 and used is 1, Place symbol into current.
Set spot to spot plus used.

Flush.
For each answer in answers, show answer.

